    <comment>python-comfy-angle 0.1.0 (Mesa/libglvnd-backed comfy-angle API). Supersedes sr#1372846 with r4: explicit Requires: libglvnd (ctypes-loaded, rpmlint filtered) plus Mesa-libEGL1 and Mesa-dri.

INTERDEPENDENT REQUESTS - please stage with the ComfyUI cone (sr#1372800).

Fri Aug 21 12:20:13 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal &lt;mpluskal@suse.com&gt;

- Initial package of python-comfy-angle 0.1.0:
  * Mesa/libglvnd-backed implementation of the comfy-angle 0.1.0
    API for ComfyUI's GLSL Shader node (optional extra
    comfy-angle)
  * Does not ship Electron-extracted Chromium ANGLE; locates
    system libEGL/libGLESv2 at runtime
  * Requires libglvnd, Mesa-libEGL1 and Mesa-dri
</comment>
